| v25 | 把 ERoomTeam 替换成 FGameplayTag (Single Source of Truth 一致) | Pawn.FactionTag 没加 Replicated |
| v26 | CachedFactionTag + Spawn/Respawn 链路 | 关卡预放 PlayerStart 默认归 Attack (静默兜底) |
| v26.5 | Profile.FactionTag 兜底 → 强制 CachedFactionTag (与 Pawn.FactionTag 同步) | PlayerState.CurrentFactionTag → Pawn.FactionTag 的同步链路没建立 |
| **v27** | ✅ 拒绝 PlayerStart 静默归类 | ✅ Pawn.FactionTag 加 Replicated + 同步点 |
| | ✅ AI 看玩家能正确判定敌我 |

