### 用户反馈
> "@f:\Desktop\Session1.log 玩家和ai手上没有武器。"

### Session1.log 核心错误链
```
[ABaseCharacter] 构造函数 EXIT: BP_SWAT_C WeaponAttach=0x...257DE70140 (有值!)
[WeaponAttachmentComponent] BeginPlay: Owner=BP_SWAT_C_0, CharacterID='', SpawnWeaponID='', CurrentWeapon=None
[BaseCharacter] SetSpawnLoadout ENTER: BP_SWAT_C WeaponAttach=0x0000000000000000 (NULL!)
[SetSpawnLoadout: WeaponAttach 字段为 nullptr!]
